::GEO_U04_L06_Q01::
Question ID:<br>GEO_U04_L06_Q01<br><br>MLA Standard:<br>MLA.GEO.TRI.4<br><br>Question:<br>Which ratio defines sine? {
=A. <sup>opposite</sup>&frasl;<sub>hypotenuse</sub>#Sine compares the opposite side to the hypotenuse.
~B. <sup>adjacent</sup>&frasl;<sub>hypotenuse</sub>#This defines cosine.
~C. <sup>opposite</sup>&frasl;<sub>adjacent</sub>#This defines tangent.
~D. <sup>hypotenuse</sup>&frasl;<sub>opposite</sub>#This reverses sine. T
}

